  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Services Agreement is envisaged to provide a framework for services requested by the recipient, for its ongoing initiatives, for each it bears full accountability. Most development services envisaged under this Agreement relate to support to policy making through research, advocacy or policy alternatives, aimed at fulfilling priorities as articulated in the Government plans. Specifically, the Agreement shall support the Office for IT and e-Government (ITE) and the government Team</narrative>
  </description>
